00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:29.550
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:29.550
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:14.810 --> 00:02:16.730
<i>Tesadan Tesadan</i>

00:02:17.680 --> 00:02:20.060
<i>Yui Ramu Nochi</i>

00:02:55.560 --> 00:02:57.270
What a foolish thing!

00:03:09.070 --> 00:03:10.260
Just like always.

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:14.180
You do nothing but make the wrong choices.

00:03:15.030 --> 00:03:16.060
ADELE

00:03:16.450 --> 00:03:18.310
Isn't that right, Agnes?

00:03:20.120 --> 00:03:21.060
Adele...

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:23.520
AGNES

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:25.610
You think you can run?

00:03:25.610 --> 00:03:26.780
This castle is...

00:03:26.780 --> 00:03:29.530
No. From destiny.

00:03:31.260 --> 00:03:33.990
Give me the ring, Agnes.

00:03:33.990 --> 00:03:35.890
Never!

00:03:45.440 --> 00:03:46.900
Agnes!

00:03:49.190 --> 00:03:50.240
After her!

00:03:57.160 --> 00:03:58.240
Who...?!

00:04:00.430 --> 00:04:03.540
I'll choose where I go!

00:04:12.170 --> 00:04:17.490
<i>Little witch, little witch
Little girl of magic</i>

00:04:17.490 --> 00:04:22.980
<i>Where you proceed is my desire</i>

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:26.690
CHAPTER 27

00:04:27.230 --> 00:04:31.630
INVASION! THE BACKBEARD ARMY

00:04:35.490 --> 00:04:39.480
<i>Bi, bi, bibibi no bi</i>

00:04:39.480 --> 00:04:43.650
<i>Any opportunities for profit anywhere?</i>

00:04:43.650 --> 00:04:47.020
<i>The reason the sky's so blue</i>

00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:50.650
<i>The reason the fish aren't biting at all</i>

00:04:50.650 --> 00:04:55.180
<i>It's all the fault of politics</i>

00:04:56.640 --> 00:04:58.410
Huh? What?

00:05:07.650 --> 00:05:10.590
They're <i>yokai</i> who drifted to Japan.

00:05:10.590 --> 00:05:12.050
Drifted?

00:05:16.360 --> 00:05:21.600
Their home country was ruined,
and they barely escaped with their lives.

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:24.500
It's a sad story.

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:29.230
And so...

00:05:29.230 --> 00:05:33.740
<i>Yokai</i> of Japan, I must swallow my pride
and beg of you.

00:05:33.740 --> 00:05:36.280
Please let us use these woods as...

00:05:37.220 --> 00:05:38.490
MIMINAGA

00:05:38.490 --> 00:05:40.120
Don't finish that thought.

00:05:40.120 --> 00:05:41.200
Huh?

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:45.830
Though from different lands,
we're all <i>yokai</i>.

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:48.730
Stay here as long as you like.

00:05:49.400 --> 00:05:51.840
This is Japanese <i>sake</i>. Want some?

00:05:51.840 --> 00:05:53.590
Hold on a second!

00:05:53.590 --> 00:05:56.510
Rat Man, you're against this?

00:05:56.510 --> 00:06:01.010
Hah! Do I really look like
such a heartless guy?

00:06:01.010 --> 00:06:03.240
Everyone's absolutely welcome here!

00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:06.350
So, about the rent...

00:06:06.350 --> 00:06:07.690
Rat Man!

00:06:07.690 --> 00:06:11.150
I-I-I-I'll hold the deposit and key money!

00:06:11.150 --> 00:06:12.750
Give it a rest!

00:06:13.210 --> 00:06:15.950
Come on! Don't be like that!

00:06:15.950 --> 00:06:16.990
Huh?

00:06:21.010 --> 00:06:24.750
From now on we're family! Brothers!
Best of friends!

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:29.750
If you ever need anything,
don't be afraid to ask for it!

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:31.060
From him.

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:33.290
Later!

00:06:35.980 --> 00:06:37.670
That Rat Man...

00:06:38.200 --> 00:06:40.220
We'll return your jewels later.

00:06:40.220 --> 00:06:43.930
It's fine. You were kind enough to
take us in anyway.

00:06:43.930 --> 00:06:47.120
So, what happened where ya guys came from?

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:54.210
Whenever I ask them,
they always act like this.

00:06:59.740 --> 00:07:02.790
We followed the unique waves
emitted by the ring,

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:06.460
but someone interfered,
and the signal was temporarily lost...

00:07:06.460 --> 00:07:08.390
Fool!

00:07:09.980 --> 00:07:11.400
Adele.

00:07:11.810 --> 00:07:16.230
That ring is the key to
the Brigadoon Project.

00:07:16.820 --> 00:07:19.050
I'm sure you're aware of that.

00:07:19.050 --> 00:07:23.620
Yes! I swear I shall get the ring back.

00:07:27.660 --> 00:07:29.330
Adele-sama.

00:07:31.690 --> 00:07:33.380
Wolfgang.

00:07:34.840 --> 00:07:37.300
I see you got the riot act.

00:07:38.170 --> 00:07:39.450
WOLFGANG

00:07:39.450 --> 00:07:42.910
So, have you found where the ring is?

00:07:42.910 --> 00:07:44.450
Yes. Japan.

00:07:44.930 --> 00:07:46.660
Very well.

00:07:46.660 --> 00:07:50.730
Then allow me, Wolfgang to go there.

00:07:57.980 --> 00:08:04.320
As thanks for your welcome, allow us to
offer specialty cooking from our country.

00:08:09.330 --> 00:08:13.270
Fortunately, the forest was
full of ingredients.

00:08:13.270 --> 00:08:15.110
Is it not your liking?

00:08:15.110 --> 00:08:17.610
N-No, that's not it!

00:08:17.610 --> 00:08:20.320
Catchick, you're being rude.

00:08:20.320 --> 00:08:23.880
Obviously food culture is different in
different countries.

00:08:29.620 --> 00:08:32.980
This is perfect with some <i>sake</i>.

00:08:52.330 --> 00:08:56.110
Don't be stupid! We can't beat them!

00:08:56.110 --> 00:08:58.750
We'll fight nonetheless!

00:08:59.590 --> 00:09:03.550
We can't just sit back
after what they did to our home!

00:09:10.350 --> 00:09:13.660
Dancing's the only way
to deal with the pain!

00:09:20.320 --> 00:09:22.480
I can't sleep...

00:09:23.400 --> 00:09:24.840
We're counting on you.

00:09:24.840 --> 00:09:27.490
I'm not looking forward to this.

00:09:29.680 --> 00:09:31.640
That's the case.

00:09:31.640 --> 00:09:36.580
Hmm. So you won't even let us
grieve for our home?

00:09:37.690 --> 00:09:41.650
It's not just about the music.

00:09:55.100 --> 00:10:00.190
Biddy is a <i>yokai</i> who pees in rivers.
It can't be helped.

00:10:01.400 --> 00:10:02.670
There's also...

00:10:06.800 --> 00:10:12.640
The Take-Nezumi spirits are <i>yokai</i>
that eat bamboo. It can't be helped.

00:10:12.640 --> 00:10:15.690
Different countries
have different customs.

00:10:15.690 --> 00:10:18.860
I'm aware of that.

00:10:18.860 --> 00:10:23.000
But, if you can't accept our customs,

00:10:23.500 --> 00:10:26.610
you never should have
allowed us to live here!

00:10:26.610 --> 00:10:28.280
If I may,

00:10:28.280 --> 00:10:32.740
Japan has the saying, "one should
conform to the custom of the land."

00:10:32.740 --> 00:10:36.250
Respecting diversity is the
mainstay of international norms!

00:10:36.830 --> 00:10:37.960
Diversity!

00:10:37.960 --> 00:10:39.170
Inclusion!

00:10:39.170 --> 00:10:40.920
Political correctness!

00:10:41.420 --> 00:10:45.420
Japan's human rights awareness can
only be described as medieval!

00:10:45.420 --> 00:10:49.030
In order to be respected
as a nation in international society...

00:10:49.860 --> 00:10:51.930
You let him out-debate you?!

00:10:51.930 --> 00:10:53.680
In that case,

00:10:53.680 --> 00:11:00.560
you should reply, "In Rome they say,
'when in Rome, do as the Romans do'"!

00:11:00.560 --> 00:11:04.130
Huh. I've never heard that saying before.

00:11:08.510 --> 00:11:10.900
But it's our land...

00:11:11.430 --> 00:11:14.160
But they took all our jewels...

00:11:15.810 --> 00:11:18.170
-It's unfortunate.
-Indeed.

00:11:18.170 --> 00:11:21.290
Miminaga-san,
couldn't we talk this over again?

00:11:21.290 --> 00:11:23.630
We've talked enough.

00:11:23.630 --> 00:11:25.710
Keeping out of each other's way.

00:11:25.710 --> 00:11:30.340
That's probably
the best option, Kitaro-san.

00:11:30.340 --> 00:11:32.300
Hmm.

00:11:32.300 --> 00:11:33.810
The refugee problem.

00:11:33.810 --> 00:11:39.120
It's an issue we cannot avoid
living in the 21st century.

00:11:42.310 --> 00:11:45.900
You're the one who complicated things
by taking the jewels!

00:11:46.550 --> 00:11:49.910
Yet here you are with that smug
talk show host expression!

00:11:49.910 --> 00:11:52.010
You piss me off!

00:11:52.590 --> 00:11:55.080
It's not my fault!
It's the cryptocurrency market!

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:56.180
What?!

00:11:57.510 --> 00:11:58.290
Ow!

00:11:58.560 --> 00:12:00.290
What's wrong, Rat Man?

00:12:08.110 --> 00:12:09.470
A jewel?

00:12:09.470 --> 00:12:11.720
I kept one as a keepsake.

00:12:12.030 --> 00:12:14.820
Did we ever have a jewel like that?

00:12:15.660 --> 00:12:17.140
Something's strange.

00:12:22.460 --> 00:12:25.850
My spell of mimicry was broken
from the outside?!

00:12:25.850 --> 00:12:30.150
No. Someone used Adele's magic stone?

00:12:30.150 --> 00:12:31.720
Who are you?

00:12:32.840 --> 00:12:34.550
Agnes-sama.

00:12:39.450 --> 00:12:41.290
Wolfgang!

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:45.000
Please return to the castle, Agnes-sama.

00:12:45.310 --> 00:12:47.630
-What's going on?
-Don't know.

00:12:47.630 --> 00:12:49.590
Th-That's...!

00:12:49.590 --> 00:12:54.400
Th-That's one of the guys
who ruined our country!

00:12:55.530 --> 00:12:57.160
What?!

00:12:59.870 --> 00:13:02.180
WITCH

00:13:03.040 --> 00:13:06.690
MALAY <i>YOKAI</i> MIMINAGA

00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:05.620
-<i>"Yeah, yeah. You're hot and cold."</i>
-<i>"Huh?!"</i>

00:13:05.750 --> 00:13:06.630
<i>"What'd I do?"</i>

00:13:23.100 --> 00:13:27.400
They destroyed our home and our friends!

00:13:28.400 --> 00:13:31.750
You've come after me, Wolfgang.

00:13:33.670 --> 00:13:38.060
Agnes-sama, Adele-sama is
disappointed in you.

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:39.740
Hey, you.

00:13:49.630 --> 00:13:51.280
We're trapped!

00:13:51.280 --> 00:13:53.150
Wh-What is that?!

00:13:53.800 --> 00:13:55.470
Stay there.

00:13:56.200 --> 00:14:00.410
I was correct for coming
in Adele-sama's stead.

00:14:00.410 --> 00:14:04.460
You've both just lost your mother.

00:14:04.460 --> 00:14:08.370
You should at least support each other
like sisters for now.

00:14:14.590 --> 00:14:16.050
Dad, what is that?!

00:14:16.050 --> 00:14:18.380
It must be Western magic.

00:14:23.620 --> 00:14:25.310
Honestly.

00:14:25.700 --> 00:14:31.290
I promised Adele-sama to bring you
and the ring back unharmed.

00:14:31.790 --> 00:14:34.300
Don't force my hand any further.

00:14:36.030 --> 00:14:38.360
Let go of me! Let go!

00:14:38.680 --> 00:14:44.040
The Brigadoon Project cannot proceed
without that ring, you see.

00:14:44.040 --> 00:14:45.910
The Brigadoon Project?

00:14:45.910 --> 00:14:48.790
It can't be... Japan, too?!

00:14:50.350 --> 00:14:52.960
Who said you could speak?

00:14:56.050 --> 00:14:58.360
Don't try it!

00:15:02.030 --> 00:15:05.060
The reason you're still alive

00:15:05.060 --> 00:15:09.000
is because you didn't have the spirit
to die with your homeland.

00:15:09.710 --> 00:15:12.520
It's because you're garbage!

00:15:18.030 --> 00:15:21.300
Cowardly, homeless filth.

00:15:22.800 --> 00:15:24.040
H-Hey!

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:26.960
This time... This time...!

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:28.290
What?

00:15:28.290 --> 00:15:31.730
I'll protect our new home!

00:15:33.880 --> 00:15:35.000
No!

00:15:40.880 --> 00:15:42.630
Miminaga!

00:16:02.610 --> 00:16:04.820
Finger Guns!

00:16:08.410 --> 00:16:11.290
He broke Adele's barrier spell
with one hit?!

00:16:12.480 --> 00:16:14.670
Oh? Interesting.

00:16:14.670 --> 00:16:17.210
This is for Miminaga!

00:16:21.920 --> 00:16:22.970
What?!

00:16:22.970 --> 00:16:25.010
How ruthless!

00:16:25.410 --> 00:16:27.930
This is unforgivable!

00:16:28.410 --> 00:16:30.450
I am Wolfgang.

00:16:30.750 --> 00:16:32.480
What is your name?

00:16:32.480 --> 00:16:35.440
I'll need to know to
carve it into the grave.

00:16:35.440 --> 00:16:36.650
Kitaro!

00:16:36.650 --> 00:16:38.320
GeGeGe no Kitaro!

00:16:39.090 --> 00:16:42.010
The moon isn't out yet,
but this should be fine.

00:17:01.510 --> 00:17:03.650
Spirit Hair Chanchanko!

00:17:06.870 --> 00:17:07.720
Whoops!

00:17:07.720 --> 00:17:08.720
Take this!

00:17:16.080 --> 00:17:17.380
Hey, you!

00:17:24.150 --> 00:17:25.660
Hair Needles!

00:17:25.660 --> 00:17:27.050
Hah!

00:17:28.260 --> 00:17:29.530
Oh no you don't!

00:17:32.980 --> 00:17:34.190
Where's my jewel?

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:38.500
Th-That was just me using a mimicry spell
to disguise myself.

00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:40.980
Dammit! Just my luck!

00:17:41.480 --> 00:17:42.880
One more question.

00:17:42.880 --> 00:17:44.840
Where can I run that's safe?

00:17:48.070 --> 00:17:49.600
You're useless!

00:17:49.600 --> 00:17:50.700
So long!

00:17:52.490 --> 00:17:54.330
<i>Where can I run?</i>

00:17:54.870 --> 00:17:56.520
You think you can run?

00:17:56.520 --> 00:17:57.980
This castle is...

00:17:57.980 --> 00:18:00.730
No. From destiny.

00:18:09.220 --> 00:18:12.990
Wally Wall!

00:18:14.270 --> 00:18:17.750
Japanese <i>yokai</i>, is that all you've got?

00:18:25.090 --> 00:18:26.550
But...!

00:18:26.550 --> 00:18:30.060
He's regenerating any damage he takes!

00:18:30.060 --> 00:18:32.560
Does he have any weaknesses?!

00:18:32.560 --> 00:18:36.230
I don't know much about Western <i>yokai</i>.

00:18:36.870 --> 00:18:38.190
I know.

00:18:38.190 --> 00:18:40.630
I'll carve this on the grave,

00:18:40.960 --> 00:18:46.190
"GeGeGe no Kitaro rests here.
He couldn't do anything."

00:18:47.880 --> 00:18:49.220
Die!

00:18:50.090 --> 00:18:51.030
You?!

00:18:52.220 --> 00:18:53.430
Use this!

00:18:55.140 --> 00:18:56.080
Is this...?

00:18:56.480 --> 00:18:58.650
It looks like a silver bullet.

00:18:58.650 --> 00:18:59.670
Silver?

00:19:01.400 --> 00:19:02.380
Kitaro!

00:19:09.990 --> 00:19:11.300
Finger Guns!

00:19:21.080 --> 00:19:23.230
Agnes-sama!

00:19:23.540 --> 00:19:25.280
A silver bullet...

00:19:25.280 --> 00:19:31.130
You'd tell the Japanese <i>yokai</i>
the weakness of one of your own?!

00:19:31.490 --> 00:19:33.330
Go tell Adele,

00:19:33.330 --> 00:19:35.560
I'm going to fight my destiny.

00:19:41.230 --> 00:19:42.500
He disappeared?

00:19:42.500 --> 00:19:44.480
It's a magic stone of teleportation.

00:19:51.910 --> 00:19:55.020
If we'd had
another chance to talk it over...

00:19:55.020 --> 00:19:57.510
The results would have been the same.

00:19:57.870 --> 00:19:59.330
I know.

00:19:59.710 --> 00:20:00.750
But...

00:20:11.260 --> 00:20:13.200
Who are you?

00:20:13.200 --> 00:20:17.370
What was that Brigadoon Project
they were talking about?

00:20:18.470 --> 00:20:20.370
-Protect me.
-Huh?

00:20:20.890 --> 00:20:23.670
They're after me.

00:20:23.670 --> 00:20:24.960
Protect me.

00:20:26.900 --> 00:20:30.210
All right. What's your name?

00:20:30.210 --> 00:20:31.680
It's Agnes.

00:20:31.680 --> 00:20:34.410
Nice to meet you, GeGeGe no Kitaro.

00:20:48.150 --> 00:20:53.410
I just let my guard down this time.
Send me back to Japan again.

00:20:53.410 --> 00:20:55.390
Next time is with everyone.

00:21:01.100 --> 00:21:04.210
VICTOR FRANKENSTEIN

00:21:05.810 --> 00:21:08.960
CARMILLA

00:21:09.440 --> 00:21:11.380
We're taking our strongest forces.

00:21:11.380 --> 00:21:12.650
But...

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:15.780
Backbeard-sama has commanded it.

00:21:23.000 --> 00:21:25.480
BACKBEARD

00:21:26.000 --> 00:21:31.380
We shall now begin a war
with the Japanese <i>yokai</i>.

00:21:31.980 --> 00:21:35.860
The Great Yokai War!

00:21:40.390 --> 00:21:45.350
<i>War... People...
Duckweeds...</i>

00:21:45.890 --> 00:21:50.320
<i>Withered grass that foolishly fights</i>

00:21:50.730 --> 00:21:55.110
<i>Let it burn and spread
Leaving a burnt field</i>

00:21:55.240 --> 00:22:02.120
<i>Such hatred is truly a supreme nectar</i>

00:22:06.620 --> 00:22:10.500
<i>You can't see them
But they're there</i>

00:22:06.620 --> 00:22:10.500
<i>mien keredomo orundayo</i>

00:22:12.050 --> 00:22:14.340
<i>"Hello" in the mountains</i>

00:22:12.050 --> 00:22:14.340
<i>yama de yahho</i>

00:22:14.460 --> 00:22:17.260
<i>If you call</i>

00:22:14.460 --> 00:22:17.260
<i>hitokoe yobeba</i>

00:22:17.380 --> 00:22:19.550
<i>An identical "Hello"</i>

00:22:17.380 --> 00:22:19.550
<i>onaji yahho</i>

00:22:19.680 --> 00:22:24.850
<i>The Yobuko calls back</i>

00:22:19.680 --> 00:22:24.850
<i>yobuko ga kaesu</i>

00:22:25.180 --> 00:22:27.440
<i>A tree spirit living in the mountains</i>

00:22:25.180 --> 00:22:27.440
<i>yama ni sunderu ki no seirei</i>

00:22:30.650 --> 00:22:32.860
<i>A used rag</i>

00:22:30.650 --> 00:22:32.860
<i>tsukatta zoukin</i>

00:22:32.980 --> 00:22:35.740
<i>If you don't keep it clean</i>

00:22:32.980 --> 00:22:35.740
<i>kirei ni shinaito</i>

00:22:35.990 --> 00:22:38.110
<i>It'll get smelly</i>

00:22:35.990 --> 00:22:38.110
<i>kusaku nattayo</i>

00:22:38.240 --> 00:22:43.490
<i>The Shiro-Uneri
Will tangle itself around you</i>

00:22:38.240 --> 00:22:43.490
<i>shirouneri karamitsuku</i>

00:22:43.790 --> 00:22:46.040
<i>Stuck to your face
How horrible</i>

00:22:43.790 --> 00:22:46.040
<i>kao ni bettori korya tamaran</i>

00:22:46.160 --> 00:22:51.540
<i>See how many ghosts there are</i>

00:22:46.160 --> 00:22:51.540
<i>konnani oruyo obaketachi</i>

00:22:51.670 --> 00:22:54.090
<i>You can't see them
But they're there</i>

00:22:51.670 --> 00:22:54.090
<i>mien keredomo orundayo</i>

00:22:54.210 --> 00:22:59.010
<i>You can't see them
But they're there</i>

00:22:54.210 --> 00:22:59.010
<i>mien keredomo orundayo</i>

00:22:59.760 --> 00:23:03.430
<i>They're near you</i>

00:22:59.760 --> 00:23:03.430
<i>kimi no chikaku ni</i>

00:23:06.520 --> 00:23:09.230
<i>The most powerful</i>
<i>Western </i>yokai<i> army approaches.</i>

00:23:09.600 --> 00:23:11.900
<i>Dad, the GeGeGe Forest...!</i>

00:23:12.480 --> 00:23:14.780
<i>Next time on GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:23:15.230 --> 00:23:16.900
<i>"The Great Yokai War"</i>

00:23:17.030 --> 00:23:19.450
<i>The door to the unseen world opens...</i>
